{"title":"牧羊人","url":"https://www.shephe.com/","favicon":"https://www.shephe.com/favicon.ico","elements":[{"title":"路西久野复古胶片调色思路，情绪人像调色 PSD","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/resources/%e8%b7%af%e8%a5%bf%e4%b9%85%e9%87%8e%e8%b0%83%e8%89%b2%e8%b5%84%e6%ba%90%e5%8c%85/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">路西久野复古胶片调色思路，情绪人像调色 PSD</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://assets.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/清新窗台.webp 1600w, https://assets.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/清新窗台-768x512.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-08-29T10:22:31+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t08/29/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>路西久野复古胶片调色思路，情绪人像调色 PSD</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>路西久野是谁？我看了一下此人并非传统意义上的摄影名家，而是一个地地道道的中国摄影师，他的照片多以胶片风、情绪风为主，常被人形容“像电影截图一样”，“画面里全是故事，情绪、氛围、色调都是满分”。 你可以在微博、小红书等平台去看看他的片子，年轻…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/resources/%e8%b7%af%e8%a5%bf%e4%b9%85%e9%87%8e%e8%b0%83%e8%89%b2%e8%b5%84%e6%ba%90%e5%8c%85/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/resources/%e8%b7%af%e8%a5%bf%e4%b9%85%e9%87%8e%e8%b0%83%e8%89%b2%e8%b5%84%e6%ba%90%e5%8c%85/","r