s/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Goodbye, Memos</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://assets.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/shephe.com_08-28_10-39.webp 1600w, https://assets.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/shephe.com_08-28_10-39-768x432.webp 768w, https://assets.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/shephe.com_08-28_10-39-1390x782.webp 1390w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-08-28T11:19:10+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t08/28/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>Goodbye, Memos</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>我翻了翻自己在 Memos 上的第一条动态，是在 2024 年年中发的。那时候应该是看了五木大神的帖子「</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/goodbye-memos/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/life/goodbye-memos/","retrieved":1756403129867},{"title":"ClassicFilm 2 - Pro Lightroom 配置文件 / 电影感调色","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/resources/classicfilm-2-pro-lightroom-profile/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">ClassicFilm 2 - Pro Lightroom 配置文件 / 电影感调色</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://assets.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ClassicFilm-2-Pro-Lightroom.webp\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-08-27T18:53:53+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t08/27/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>ClassicFilm 2 - Pro Lightroom 配置文件 / 电影感调色</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>在当下数码摄影盛行的时代，很多摄影师和爱好者依然对胶片影像情有独钟。胶片不仅仅是一种成像方式，更是一种色彩和质感的表达。然而，真正使用胶片拍摄需要耗费大量时间和成本，因此模拟胶片风格的软件工具便成为许多摄影师的选择。ClassicFilm …</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/resources/classicfilm-2-pro-lightroom-profile/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/resources/classicfilm-2-pro-lightroom-profile/","retrieved":1756316776009},{"title":"WordPress 服务器性能测试优化方案 & 迁移记录","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/website/aliyun-to-baidu-cloud-migration/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">WordPress 服务器性能测试优化方案 &amp; 迁移记录</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://assets.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Server-Room.webp 1200w, https://assets.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Server-Room-768x432.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-08-26T18:42:52+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t08/26/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>WordPress 服务器性能测试优化方案 &amp; 迁移记录</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>前段时间，我抢了一台腾讯的轻量云服务器，本来都已经把本站迁移过去了，但结果发现那台机器的性能实在太差了，动不动就卡爆，只好回退到阿里云这边了。通过这次迁移，我倒是把整个过程走了一遍，积累了一些经验。同时，也让我重新考虑换服务器的事。这仔细一…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/website/aliyun-to-baidu-cloud-migration/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/website/aliyun-to-baidu-cloud-migration/","retrieved":1756230343330},{"title":"RNI All Films 5 Lightroom / ACR 电影感调色预设包","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/resources/rni-all-films-5-preset/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">RNI All Films 5 Lightroom / ACR 电影感调色预设包</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://assets.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/chair.jpg 1000w, https://assets.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/chair-768x512.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-headi